    "parent_id": "6c3dadbd-1ccb-43da-b4a2-1d94282157ca",
    "content": "- **Severity P2 (Major Degradation):** Non-blocking service failure or customer portal partial impairment. SLA Response Time: 1 hour. Escalation: SRE Lead on-call. - **Severity P3 (Minor Glitch):** Cosmetic UI issues or non-critical background batch job delays. SLA Response Time: 4 business hours.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 1,
