    "parent_id": "6c3dadbd-1ccb-43da-b4a2-1d94282157ca",
    "content": "SLA Response Time: 4 business hours. ## 2. Standard Production Error Code Reference\nThe following error codes correspond to internal telemetry events: - `ERR-502-TIMEOUT`: Upstream gateway timed out waiting for backend gRPC response (>30,000ms).",
