    "parent_id": "e72eb232-9d13-4f9e-aa42-8e5a47511789",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
