    "content": "# Global Employee Leave and Remote Working Policy ## 1. Annual Leave Entitlement\nFull-time regular employees accrue 24 paid annual leave days per calendar year. - A maximum of 5 unused leave days may be carried over into the following year, expiring by March 31st.",
